    "detailed_description": "This is a simple casual game<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers need to control the spiders and destroy the bees that come.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter the game starts, the bees will appear constantly from the right.<br />\r\nThe bee will fly from the right to the left.<br />\r\nThere are fast flying, flying slow.<br />\r\nWhen the bee hits the spider, the game is over.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers want to control spiders and avoid bees<br />\r\nIt is also possible to fire bullets and eliminate bees.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAt the top of the screen, it shows how much time has passed and how many bees have been eliminated.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMethod of operation<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControl the spider movement with the mouse<br />\r\nWhere does the mouse move and where does the spider move?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nleft mouse button<br />\r\nAfter clicking, the spider will fire a bullet.<br />\r\n\u53d1\u9001\u53cd\u9988<br />\r\n\u5386\u53f2\u8bb0\u5f55",
